# Bug Report 1

## Title 
Application becomes unresponsive when generating > 1,000,000 dates in Microsoft Edge

## Environment
- Browser: Microsoft Edge (Latest) 
- OS: Windows
- URL: https://codebeautify.org/generate-random-date

## Severity
High

## Priority 
Medium 

## Steps to Reproduce 
1. Open the Random Date Generater tool.
2. Leave default date range values.
3. Enter "1,000,000" in the " How many dates to generate?" field.
Click "Generate"

## Expected Result
The application should either:
- Restrict the user from excessively large inputs
- Display a validation error message
- Handle the request without freezing the browser.

## Actual Result 
- The browser displays a "Page unresponsive" dialog.
- The application becomes unsuable.
- User must wait or exit the process.
